{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_002_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a44727dee4b6de648ae2f8faf8d66abfd938b1ddf53279c0df01bbd4b4216f19",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e3dfd72e52cbdd1a80a58b729a98e9afa91c5691b50b52390d8939ccaaf2ea0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n工作辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0ed8afab849e33d89c0f7082b6b24b736b4531342b8a457cb72826b2972ce4",
      "text": "今天不是白色情人节嘛？\n因为有想给你的东西，所以一直在等呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2b07ae50575c25da6b23b1486647249cc300171995cbbe321cbff8a26ad77b9",
      "text": "给，这个！\n情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:810ec6e013dfdadc54ee79cdea6e54ca868011b47f3f8e89308389bbf3eea182",
      "text": "收到的巧克力超级好吃哦。\n谢谢你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3575b5d164bc5a01e20f07c4f5d44bfa0ff524d616276a5349e3e141f6f8597c",
      "text": "明年的情人节也请多多指教啦～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22a0ebd324e57c88cfd1244f8abb0a852da5f742cf0d4ab743400e071e92dec6",
      "text": "啊，在呢在呢！\n辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a38e4168a5e6cf934c0a6e4c2064f45c52d87dfd06ce5856c8f6bec3afed1434",
      "text": "现在稍微聊两句没事吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c991b51a6a74207b65bd16156b4c87c74d5956a9e5ab0b32912f984850255517",
      "text": "没关系哦。怎么啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000022:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b48f9115e221af31554fb4cc727522e2a6f6a640fa8995bb9fe06c36eb750f5a",
      "text": "没问题的！有什么事情想商量吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a84c1e6c23d3efcb80f74e2e3e9bfd425e76e0dac8e5b80f36ad6dd9a8458381",
      "text": "呼呼呼……我给制作人带了\n好东西过来哦♪ 给，情人节的回礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98f5f7d52118fc63871350e96b651749505a5aa4c282ac20294fcd5a554b7b94",
      "text": "不是商量啦。\n给，这个。我带了情人节的回礼过来哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39b8ee91f08c0a9273c926010399b5c68e24777d05a93e21bb65f22feefc6e63",
      "text": "虽然我觉得只要是我送的，制作人\n无论是什么都会高兴地收下的，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2f12f4338e62bc868dcc30f61b2970e33922cde7223cf2046fa1c356e899798",
      "text": "不过我还是琢磨了好多选出来的哦。\n反正都要送，当然希望能让你格外开心嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93e021a1964181d1a23164c08c53fdd62637c55ecf60bc4bf5041bf0c276fc81",
      "text": "里面的东西拆开之后才能揭晓哦♪\n我很期待听到感想呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_002_22:5_02_002_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:680a009974d317441cf8ef50ffbbe257e8f29bfe87c7baa1afe571d80bb677db",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该走啦。\n●●●●プロデューサー，回头见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
